notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T20:41:31.635Z",pi-agent,"Evidence: The single actionable unknown-author event is _workspace line 1 (op config:set:governance.duplicate_detection_mode, ts 2026-07-25T12:06:22.309Z). git log -S traced it to commit 9ba2fe6 'chore(governance): enable duplicate-detection advisory mode and adopt pm-cli 2026.7.25 (#22)' authored by Steve Preu <stefan@preu.at>. Attribution acknowledged via append-only audit event in _workspace.jsonl. Note: pm history-author-acknowledge has a regex bug ( /^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$/i rejects _workspace which starts with _), so the SDK appendWorkspaceAuditEvent function was called directly to produce the identical audit event."
